																								<script type="text/javascript">
							var StoreDefaults = {"PartnerEventStore":[{"gid":"686394429475397169","clan_steamid":"103582791475795589","event_name":"\ud83c\udf89Thank you! Dude, Trust Me finished #42 in Steam Next Fest's Top Demos\u2764\ufe0f","event_type":28,"appid":5117520,"server_address":null,"server_password":null,"rtime32_start_time":1793133060,"rtime32_end_time":1793136360,"comment_count":0,"creator_steamid":"0","last_update_steamid":"0","event_notes":"see announcement body","jsondata":"{\"localized_subtitle\":[\"We're 150,000 dudes strong. Here's what you did, and what comes next.\",\"Jetzt sind wir schon 150.000 Leute. Das habt ihr geschafft, und so geht es weiter.\",\"Nous sommes d\u00e9sormais 150 000 potes. Voici ce que vous avez accompli, et la suite.\",\"Ora siamo 150.000 ragazzi. Ecco cosa avete fatto e cosa ci aspetta.\",\"\ubc8c\uc368 15\ub9cc \uba85\uc758 \uce5c\uad6c\ub4e4\uc774 \ubaa8\uc600\uc2b5\ub2c8\ub2e4. \uc5ec\ub7ec\ubd84\uc774 \ud574\ub0b8 \uc77c\uacfc \uc55e\uc73c\ub85c\uc758 \uacc4\ud68d\uc744 \uc804\ud574\ub4dc\ub824\uc694.\",\"Ya somos 150.000 colegas. Esto es lo que hab\u00e9is conseguido y lo que viene ahora.\",\"\u5144\u5f1f\u4eec\u5df2\u7ecf\u6709 15 \u4e07\u4eba\u4e86\uff01\u770b\u770b\u4f60\u4eec\u505a\u5230\u4e86\u4ec0\u4e48\uff0c\u4ee5\u53ca\u63a5\u4e0b\u6765\u7684\u8ba1\u5212\u3002\",\"\u5144\u5f1f\u5011\u5df2\u7d93\u6709 15 \u842c\u4eba\u4e86\uff01\u4f86\u770b\u770b\u4f60\u5011\u7684\u6210\u7e3e\uff0c\u9084\u6709\u63a5\u4e0b\u4f86\u7684\u8a08\u756b\u3002\",\"\u041d\u0430\u0441 \u0443\u0436\u0435 150 000 \u0447\u0443\u0432\u0430\u043a\u043e\u0432. \u0412\u043e\u0442 \u0447\u0442\u043e \u0432\u044b \u0441\u0434\u0435\u043b\u0430\u043b\u0438 \u0438 \u0447\u0442\u043e \u0431\u0443\u0434\u0435\u0442 \u0434\u0430\u043b\u044c\u0448\u0435.\",null,\"15\u4e07\u4eba\u306e\u4ef2\u9593\u304c\u96c6\u307e\u308a\u307e\u3057\u305f\u3002\u307f\u3093\u306a\u306e\u6210\u679c\u3068\u3001\u3053\u308c\u304b\u3089\u306e\u3053\u3068\u3002\",null,\"Jest nas ju\u017c 150 000 ziomk\u00f3w. Oto, czego dokonali\u015bcie, i co dalej.\",null,\"We zijn nu met 150.000 gasten. Dit hebben jullie gedaan, en dit komt er nog.\",null,null,null,null,\"U\u017e je n\u00e1s 150 000 k\u00e1mo\u0161\u016f. Tohle jste dok\u00e1zali a tohle n\u00e1s \u010dek\u00e1.\",null,\"Art\u0131k 150.000 kankay\u0131z. Neler ba\u015fard\u0131\u011f\u0131m\u0131za ve s\u0131rada ne oldu\u011funa bir bak.\",\"Agora somos 150.000 par\u00e7as. Veja o que voc\u00eas fizeram e o que vem por a\u00ed.\",null,null,null,null,\"Ya somos 150,000 amigos. Esto es lo que lograron y lo que viene.\",\"Gi\u1edd \u0111\u00e3 c\u00f3 150.000 anh em r\u1ed3i. \u0110\u00e2y l\u00e0 nh\u1eefng g\u00ec m\u1ecdi ng\u01b0\u1eddi \u0111\u00e3 l\u00e0m v\u00e0 \u0111i\u1ec1u s\u1eafp t\u1edbi.\",null,null,null],\"localized_summary\":[\"#42 in Steam Next Fest's Top Demos and 150,000 dudes. Thank you for playing, dudes! \u2764\ufe0f\",\"Platz 42 der Top-Demos beim Steam Next Fest und schon 150.000 Leute. Danke f\u00fcrs Spielen! \u2764\ufe0f\",\"42e des meilleures d\u00e9mos du Steam Next Fest et 150 000 potes. Merci d'avoir jou\u00e9, les potes ! \u2764\ufe0f\",\"42\u00b0 tra le migliori demo dello Steam Next Fest e 150.000 ragazzi. Grazie per aver giocato! \u2764\ufe0f\",\"Steam Next Fest \uc778\uae30 \uccb4\ud5d8\ud310 42\uc704, \uadf8\ub9ac\uace0 15\ub9cc \uba85\uc758 \uce5c\uad6c\ub4e4! \ud50c\ub808\uc774\ud574 \uc8fc\uc154\uc11c \uace0\ub9c8\uc6cc\uc694! \u2764\ufe0f\",\"Puesto 42 entre las mejores demos del Steam Next Fest y ya somos 150.000 colegas. \u00a1Gracias por jugar! \u2764\ufe0f\",\"Steam \u65b0\u54c1\u8282\u70ed\u95e8\u8bd5\u73a9\u7b2c 42 \u540d\uff0c\u8fd8\u6709 15 \u4e07\u5144\u5f1f\uff01\u8c22\u8c22\u5927\u5bb6\u6765\u73a9\uff01\u2764\ufe0f\",\"Steam \u65b0\u54c1\u7bc0\u71b1\u9580\u8a66\u73a9\u7b2c 42 \u540d\uff0c\u9084\u6709 15 \u842c\u5144\u5f1f\uff01\u8b1d\u8b1d\u5927\u5bb6\u4f86\u73a9\uff01\u2764\ufe0f\",\"42-\u0435 \u043c\u0435\u0441\u0442\u043e \u0441\u0440\u0435\u0434\u0438 \u043b\u0443\u0447\u0448\u0438\u0445 \u0434\u0435\u043c\u043e\u0432\u0435\u0440\u0441\u0438\u0439 \u0444\u0435\u0441\u0442\u0438\u0432\u0430\u043b\u044f \u00ab\u0418\u0433\u0440\u0430\u043c \u0431\u044b\u0442\u044c\u00bb \u0438 150 000 \u0447\u0443\u0432\u0430\u043a\u043e\u0432. \u0421\u043f\u0430\u0441\u0438\u0431\u043e, \u0447\u0442\u043e \u0438\u0433\u0440\u0430\u0435\u0442\u0435! \u2764\ufe0f\",null,\"Steam Next\u30d5\u30a7\u30b9\u306e\u4eba\u6c17\u4f53\u9a13\u7248\u306742\u4f4d\u3001\u305d\u3057\u306615\u4e07\u4eba\u306e\u4ef2\u9593\uff01\u904a\u3093\u3067\u304f\u308c\u3066\u672c\u5f53\u306b\u3042\u308a\u304c\u3068\u3046\uff01\u2764\ufe0f\",null,\"42. miejsce w\u015br\u00f3d najlepszych dem Steam Next Fest i 150 000 ziomk\u00f3w. Dzi\u0119ki za gr\u0119! \u2764\ufe0f\",null,\"Plek 42 in de topdemo's van Steam Next Fest en 150.000 gasten. Bedankt voor het spelen! \u2764\ufe0f\",null,null,null,null,\"42. m\u00edsto mezi nejlep\u0161\u00edmi demy Steam Next Festu a 150 000 k\u00e1mo\u0161\u016f. D\u00edky, \u017ee hrajete! \u2764\ufe0f\",null,\"Steam Next Fest'te en iyi demolar aras\u0131nda 42. olduk ve 150.000 kankaya ula\u015ft\u0131k. Oynad\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131z i\u00e7in te\u015fekk\u00fcrler! \u2764\ufe0f\",\"42\u00ba entre as melhores demos do Steam Next Fest e 150.000 par\u00e7as. Valeu por jogar, galera! \u2764\ufe0f\",null,null,null,null,\"Puesto 42 entre las mejores demos del Steam Next Fest y ya somos 150,000 amigos. \u00a1Gracias por jugar! \u2764\ufe0f\",\"H\u1ea1ng 42 trong top demo Steam Next Fest v\u00e0 150.000 anh em. C\u1ea3m \u01a1n m\u1ecdi ng\u01b0\u1eddi \u0111\u00e3 ch\u01a1i! \u2764\ufe0f\",null,null,null],\"localized_title_image\":[\"61ab6112071419db39fd4bccce2c3c2ad811fa28.png\",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_capsule_image\":[\"eacf2b456ef95dee97005b0f25bae585679b3da0.png\",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"bSaleEnabled\":false,\"sale_show_creator\":false,\"sale_sections\":[],\"sale_browsemore_text\":\"\",\"sale_browsemore_url\":\"\",\"sale_browsemore_color\":\"\",\"sale_browsemore_bgcolor\":\"\",\"localized_sale_header\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_sale_overlay\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_sale_product_banner\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_sale_product_mobile_banner\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_sale_logo\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"sale_font\":\"\",\"sale_background_color\":\"\",\"sale_header_offset\":530,\"referenced_appids\":[],\"bBroadcastEnabled\":false,\"broadcastChatSetting\":\"hide\",\"default_broadcast_title\":\"#Broadcast_default_title_dev\",\"localized_broadcast_title\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_broadcast_left_image\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_broadcast_right_image\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"broadcast_whitelist\":[],\"bScheduleEnabled\":false,\"scheduleEntries\":[]}","announcement_body":{"gid":"686394429475397170","clanid":"46274181","posterid":"0","headline":"\ud83c\udf89Thank you! Dude, Trust Me finished #42 in Steam Next Fest's Top Demos\u2764\ufe0f","posttime":1793133110,"updatetime":1793133110,"body":"[p]Steam Next Fest is over, and we are still a little stunned: Dude, Trust Me finished #42 among the festival's top demos, and somewhere along the way we became 150,000 dudes strong. \ud83c\udf89[\/p]\n\n[h3]We read everything[\/h3]\n[p]Reviews, Discord messages, bug reports, clips and streams: we went through them all week and we're still going. A lot of it is already on our list for the full game.[\/p]\n\n[h3]What's next[\/h3]\n[p]We're heading back into development to build more puzzles and more ways to misunderstand each other. If you had fun, please add Dude, Trust Me to your wishlist. It's the biggest help you can give a small team, and Steam will tell you the moment we launch.[\/p]\n\n[p]Dude, trust us. This is just the beginning. \ud83e\udde1[\/p]","commentcount":1,"tags":["mod_reviewed","ModAct_1447510170_1793133434_0"],"language":0,"hidden":0,"forum_topic_id":"562546024123516293","event_gid":"686394429475397169","voteupcount":8,"votedowncount":0,"ban_check_result":0,"banned":0},"published":1,"hidden":0,"rtime32_visibility_start":0,"rtime32_visibility_end":0,"broadcaster_accountid":0,"follower_count":0,"ignore_count":0,"forum_topic_id":"562546024123516293","rtime32_last_modified":1793217711,"news_post_gid":"0","rtime_mod_reviewed":1793133435,"featured_app_tagid":0,"referenced_appids":[],"build_id":0,"build_branch":"","unlisted":0,"rtime_created":1793128092,"votes_up":8,"votes_down":0,"comment_type":"ForumTopic","gidfeature":"590691034935122373","gidfeature2":"562546024123516293"},{"gid":"678512495722235245","clan_steamid":"103582791475795589","event_name":"\ud83c\udf89100,000+ Dudes & 15,000+ Wishlists in Less Than a Month!\u2764\ufe0f","event_type":28,"appid":5117520,"server_address":null,"server_password":null,"rtime32_start_time":1792420680,"rtime32_end_time":1792421880,"comment_count":0,"creator_steamid":"0","last_update_steamid":"0","event_notes":"see announcement body","jsondata":"{\"localized_subtitle\":[\"100,000+ dudes joined the adventure in less than a month! Thank you for the incredible support!\u2764\ufe0f\",\"\u00dcber 100.000 Leute sind in weniger als einem Monat ins Abenteuer gestartet! Danke f\u00fcr eure riesige Unterst\u00fctzung!\u2764\ufe0f\",\"Plus de 100 000 potes ont rejoint l'aventure en moins d'un mois ! Merci pour votre soutien incroyable !\u2764\ufe0f\",\"Oltre 100.000 ragazzi si sono uniti all'avventura in meno di un mese! Grazie per l'incredibile supporto!\u2764\ufe0f\",\"\ud55c \ub2ec\ub3c4 \uc548 \ub3fc\uc11c 10\ub9cc \uba85\uc774 \ub118\ub294 \uce5c\uad6c\ub4e4\uc774 \ubaa8\ud5d8\uc5d0 \ud568\uaed8\ud574 \uc8fc\uc168\uc2b5\ub2c8\ub2e4! \uc5c4\uccad\ub09c \uc751\uc6d0 \uc815\ub9d0 \uac10\uc0ac\ud569\ub2c8\ub2e4!\u2764\ufe0f\",\"\u00a1M\u00e1s de 100.000 colegas se han unido a la aventura en menos de un mes! \u00a1Gracias por vuestro incre\u00edble apoyo!\u2764\ufe0f\",\"\u4e0d\u5230\u4e00\u4e2a\u6708\uff0c\u5df2\u6709\u8d85\u8fc7 10 \u4e07\u4f4d\u5144\u5f1f\u52a0\u5165\u5192\u9669\uff01\u611f\u8c22\u5927\u5bb6\u7684\u8d85\u5f3a\u652f\u6301\uff01\u2764\ufe0f\",\"\u4e0d\u5230\u4e00\u500b\u6708\uff0c\u5c31\u6709\u8d85\u904e 10 \u842c\u500b\u5144\u5f1f\u52a0\u5165\u5192\u96aa\uff01\u8b1d\u8b1d\u5927\u5bb6\u8d85\u5f37\u7684\u652f\u6301\uff01\u2764\ufe0f\",\"\u0411\u043e\u043b\u044c\u0448\u0435 100 000 \u0447\u0443\u0432\u0430\u043a\u043e\u0432 \u043f\u0440\u0438\u0441\u043e\u0435\u0434\u0438\u043d\u0438\u043b\u0438\u0441\u044c \u043a \u043f\u0440\u0438\u043a\u043b\u044e\u0447\u0435\u043d\u0438\u044e \u043c\u0435\u043d\u044c\u0448\u0435 \u0447\u0435\u043c \u0437\u0430 \u043c\u0435\u0441\u044f\u0446! \u0421\u043f\u0430\u0441\u0438\u0431\u043e \u0437\u0430 \u043d\u0435\u0432\u0435\u0440\u043e\u044f\u0442\u043d\u0443\u044e \u043f\u043e\u0434\u0434\u0435\u0440\u0436\u043a\u0443!\u2764\ufe0f\",null,\"1\u304b\u6708\u8db3\u3089\u305a\u306710\u4e07\u4eba\u4ee5\u4e0a\u306e\u4ef2\u9593\u304c\u5192\u967a\u306b\u53c2\u52a0\u3057\u3066\u304f\u308c\u307e\u3057\u305f\uff01\u305f\u304f\u3055\u3093\u306e\u5fdc\u63f4\u3001\u672c\u5f53\u306b\u3042\u308a\u304c\u3068\u3046\uff01\u2764\ufe0f\",null,\"Ponad 100 000 ziomk\u00f3w do\u0142\u0105czy\u0142o do przygody w nieca\u0142y miesi\u0105c! Dzi\u0119ki za niesamowite wsparcie!\u2764\ufe0f\",null,\"Meer dan 100.000 gasten begonnen in minder dan een maand aan het avontuur! Bedankt voor jullie geweldige steun!\u2764\ufe0f\",null,null,null,null,\"Za necel\u00fd m\u011bs\u00edc se do dobrodru\u017estv\u00ed pustilo p\u0159es 100 000 k\u00e1mo\u0161\u016f! D\u00edky za neuv\u011b\u0159itelnou podporu!\u2764\ufe0f\",null,\"Bir aydan k\u0131sa s\u00fcrede 100.000+ kanka maceraya kat\u0131ld\u0131! \u0130nan\u0131lmaz deste\u011finiz i\u00e7in te\u015fekk\u00fcrler!\u2764\ufe0f\",\"Mais de 100.000 par\u00e7as entraram na aventura em menos de um m\u00eas! Valeu demais pelo apoio incr\u00edvel!\u2764\ufe0f\",null,null,null,null,null,\"H\u01a1n 100.000 anh em \u0111\u00e3 tham gia cu\u1ed9c phi\u00eau l\u01b0u trong ch\u01b0a \u0111\u1ea7y m\u1ed9t th\u00e1ng! C\u1ea3m \u01a1n m\u1ecdi ng\u01b0\u1eddi \u0111\u00e3 \u1ee7ng h\u1ed9 h\u1ebft m\u00ecnh!\u2764\ufe0f\",null,null,null],\"localized_summary\":[\"100,000+ players and 15,000+ wishlists in less than a month! We never expected to grow this fast. Thank you, dudes!\u2764\ufe0f\",\"100.000+ Spieler und 15.000+ Wunschlisten in weniger als einem Monat! Mit so einem Wachstum h\u00e4tten wir nie gerechnet. Danke, Leute!\u2764\ufe0f\",\"100 000+ joueurs et 15 000+ listes de souhaits en moins d'un mois ! On ne s'attendait pas \u00e0 grandir aussi vite. Merci, les potes !\u2764\ufe0f\",\"100.000+ giocatori e 15.000+ liste dei desideri in meno di un mese! Non ci aspettavamo di crescere cos\u00ec in fretta. Grazie, ragazzi!\u2764\ufe0f\",\"\ud55c \ub2ec\ub3c4 \uc548 \ub3fc\uc11c \ud50c\ub808\uc774\uc5b4 10\ub9cc \uba85, \uc704\uc2dc\ub9ac\uc2a4\ud2b8 1.5\ub9cc \ub3cc\ud30c! \uc774\ub807\uac8c \ube68\ub9ac \ucee4\uc9c8 \uc904\uc740 \uc815\ub9d0 \ubab0\ub790\uc5b4\uc694. \ub2e4\ub4e4 \uace0\ub9c8\uc6cc\uc694!\u2764\ufe0f\",\"\u00a1100.000+ jugadores y 15.000+ listas de deseados en menos de un mes! Nunca esperamos crecer tan r\u00e1pido. \u00a1Gracias, colegas!\u2764\ufe0f\",\"\u4e0d\u5230\u4e00\u4e2a\u6708\uff0c\u73a9\u5bb6\u7a81\u7834 10 \u4e07\uff0c\u613f\u671b\u5355\u7a81\u7834 1.5 \u4e07\uff01\u6211\u4eec\u5b8c\u5168\u6ca1\u60f3\u5230\u4f1a\u6da8\u5f97\u8fd9\u4e48\u5feb\u3002\u8c22\u8c22\u4f60\u4eec\uff0c\u5144\u5f1f\u4eec\uff01\u2764\ufe0f\",\"\u4e0d\u5230\u4e00\u500b\u6708\uff0c\u73a9\u5bb6\u7a81\u7834 10 \u842c\u3001\u9858\u671b\u6e05\u55ae\u7a81\u7834 1.5 \u842c\uff01\u6211\u5011\u5b8c\u5168\u6c92\u60f3\u5230\u6703\u6210\u9577\u5f97\u9019\u9ebc\u5feb\u3002\u8b1d\u5566\uff0c\u5144\u5f1f\u5011\uff01\u2764\ufe0f\",\"100 000+ \u0438\u0433\u0440\u043e\u043a\u043e\u0432 \u0438 15 000+ \u0432\u0438\u0448\u043b\u0438\u0441\u0442\u043e\u0432 \u043c\u0435\u043d\u044c\u0448\u0435 \u0447\u0435\u043c \u0437\u0430 \u043c\u0435\u0441\u044f\u0446! \u041c\u044b \u0438 \u043f\u043e\u0434\u0443\u043c\u0430\u0442\u044c \u043d\u0435 \u043c\u043e\u0433\u043b\u0438, \u0447\u0442\u043e \u0431\u0443\u0434\u0435\u043c \u0440\u0430\u0441\u0442\u0438 \u0442\u0430\u043a \u0431\u044b\u0441\u0442\u0440\u043e. \u0421\u043f\u0430\u0441\u0438\u0431\u043e, \u0447\u0443\u0432\u0430\u043a\u0438!\u2764\ufe0f\",null,\"1\u304b\u6708\u8db3\u3089\u305a\u3067\u30d7\u30ec\u30a4\u30e4\u30fc10\u4e07\u4eba\u3001\u30a6\u30a3\u30c3\u30b7\u30e5\u30ea\u30b9\u30c81.5\u4e07\u4ef6\u3092\u7a81\u7834\uff01\u3053\u3093\u306a\u306b\u65e9\u304f\u5e83\u304c\u308b\u306a\u3093\u3066\u601d\u3063\u3066\u3082\u307f\u307e\u305b\u3093\u3067\u3057\u305f\u3002\u307f\u3093\u306a\u3001\u3042\u308a\u304c\u3068\u3046\uff01\u2764\ufe0f\",null,\"100 000+ graczy i 15 000+ list \u017cycze\u0144 w nieca\u0142y miesi\u0105c! Nigdy nie spodziewali\u015bmy si\u0119, \u017ce uro\u015bniemy tak szybko. Dzi\u0119ki, ziomki!\u2764\ufe0f\",null,\"100.000+ spelers en 15.000+ verlanglijstjes in minder dan een maand! We hadden nooit verwacht zo snel te groeien. Bedankt, gasten!\u2764\ufe0f\",null,null,null,null,\"100 000+ hr\u00e1\u010d\u016f a 15 000+ seznam\u016f p\u0159\u00e1n\u00ed za necel\u00fd m\u011bs\u00edc! Nikdy jsme ne\u010dekali, \u017ee porosteme tak rychle. D\u00edky, k\u00e1mo\u0161i!\u2764\ufe0f\",null,\"Bir aydan k\u0131sa s\u00fcrede 100.000+ oyuncu ve 15.000+ istek listesi! Bu kadar h\u0131zl\u0131 b\u00fcy\u00fcyece\u011fimizi hi\u00e7 beklemiyorduk. Sa\u011f olun kankalar!\u2764\ufe0f\",\"100.000+ jogadores e 15.000+ listas de desejos em menos de um m\u00eas! A gente nunca esperou crescer t\u00e3o r\u00e1pido. Valeu, galera!\u2764\ufe0f\",null,null,null,null,null,\"100.000+ ng\u01b0\u1eddi ch\u01a1i v\u00e0 15.000+ wishlist trong ch\u01b0a \u0111\u1ea7y m\u1ed9t th\u00e1ng! T\u1ee5i m\u00ecnh ch\u01b0a bao gi\u1edd ngh\u0129 s\u1ebd ph\u00e1t tri\u1ec3n nhanh \u0111\u1ebfn v\u1eady. C\u1ea3m \u01a1n anh em!\u2764\ufe0f\",null,null,null],\"localized_title_image\":[\"77746d192d4a17a8e8aeab68b98668e05dc1b9a3.png\",null,null,null,\"e70c55629668e715c2b58f2fca4913f831a5b19f.png\",null,\"e1f5e9f2ae044a8bc362e52cf93f915f2b0032f7.png\",\"98dc6cb2fb9e590d576823a0efdd1748b14a129e.png\",\"5bae6a090a65de09c524b6d500bf36bf416cb78b.png\",null,\"6bf4e46b0b2ea5d53d0093298b82f83bd981201a.png\",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_capsule_image\":[\"faef68e46c2c7356600759c29e4fee789d4f616a.png\",null,null,null,\"d51e667f3cdcc70b691e5e302504b33ec206d658.png\",null,\"4b2fb10cb814a08aa67306817d8f21e6d4a04601.png\",\"597199d44c18303d33e3de1ccd37a7b57863ffe3.png\",\"5a3a4403e5a0873e5101cc27884ba484ca723b1a.png\",null,\"b60e540de034210e290e29830e7ad7d391c6cb5e.png\",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"bSaleEnabled\":false,\"sale_show_creator\":false,\"sale_sections\":[],\"sale_browsemore_text\":\"\",\"sale_browsemore_url\":\"\",\"sale_browsemore_color\":\"\",\"sale_browsemore_bgcolor\":\"\",\"localized_sale_header\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_sale_overlay\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_sale_product_banner\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_sale_product_mobile_banner\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_sale_logo\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"sale_font\":\"\",\"sale_background_color\":\"\",\"sale_header_offset\":530,\"referenced_appids\":[],\"bBroadcastEnabled\":false,\"broadcastChatSetting\":\"hide\",\"default_broadcast_title\":\"#Broadcast_default_title_dev\",\"localized_broadcast_title\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_broadcast_left_image\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_broadcast_right_image\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"broadcast_whitelist\":[],\"bScheduleEnabled\":false,\"scheduleEntries\":[]}","announcement_body":{"gid":"678512495722235246","clanid":"46274181","posterid":"0","headline":"\ud83c\udf89100,000+ Dudes & 15,000+ Wishlists in Less Than a Month!\u2764\ufe0f","posttime":1792420700,"updatetime":1792421408,"body":"[b]100,000+ players. 15,000+ wishlists. WHAT?! \ud83e\udd2f\u2764\ufe0f[\/b]\n\nWe never imagined so many dudes would be dancing, punching each other, and struggling through our puzzles! \ud83d\ude02\ud83e\udd4a\n\nReaching these numbers in less than a month makes us incredibly happy! Seeing how fast our little game is growing, along with all your videos, streams, and reactions, means the world to us. \u2764\ufe0f\n\nWe're working hard to bring you even more chaos in the full game! \ud83d\udd25\n\n[b]Thank you for trusting us, dudes! \u2764\ufe0f[\/b]\n\nDude, trust me. We're just getting started!\n\nSee you at Next Fest!","commentcount":0,"tags":["mod_reviewed","ModAct_1889321037_1792428899_0"],"language":0,"hidden":0,"forum_topic_id":"570426530135649962","event_gid":"678512495722235245","voteupcount":5,"votedowncount":1,"ban_check_result":0,"banned":0},"published":1,"hidden":0,"rtime32_visibility_start":1792420680,"rtime32_visibility_end":0,"broadcaster_accountid":0,"follower_count":0,"ignore_count":0,"forum_topic_id":"570426530135649962","rtime32_last_modified":1792980835,"news_post_gid":"0","rtime_mod_reviewed":1792428900,"featured_app_tagid":0,"referenced_appids":[],"build_id":0,"build_branch":"","unlisted":0,"rtime_created":1792418235,"votes_up":5,"votes_down":1,"comment_type":"ForumTopic","gidfeature":"590691034935122373","gidfeature2":"570426530135649962"},{"gid":"678512495722234738","clan_steamid":"103582791475795589","event_name":"\ud83c\udf83 Dude, Trust Me is in costume for Halloween \ud83e\udd87","event_type":14,"appid":5117520,"server_address":null,"server_password":null,"rtime32_start_time":1792187040,"rtime32_end_time":1792191601,"comment_count":0,"creator_steamid":"0","last_update_steamid":"0","event_notes":"see announcement body","jsondata":"{\"localized_subtitle\":[\"Three costumes, four dressed-up maps and a pumpkin hat for Sefik\",null,null,null,\"\uc758\uc0c1 \uc138 \uac00\uc9c0, \uc0c8\ub85c \uafb8\ubbfc \ub9f5 \ub124 \uac1c, \uadf8\ub9ac\uace0 Sefik\uc758 \ud638\ubc15 \ubaa8\uc790\",null,\"\u4e09\u5957\u670d\u88c5\u3001\u56db\u5f20\u88c5\u626e\u4e00\u65b0\u7684\u5730\u56fe\uff0c\u8fd8\u6709 Sefik \u7684\u5357\u74dc\u5e3d\",\"\u4e09\u5957\u8b8a\u88dd\u3001\u56db\u5f35\u63db\u4e0a\u7bc0\u6176\u88dd\u98fe\u7684\u5730\u5716\uff0c\u9084\u6709 Sefik \u7684\u5357\u74dc\u5e3d\",\"\u0422\u0440\u0438 \u043a\u043e\u0441\u0442\u044e\u043c\u0430, \u0447\u0435\u0442\u044b\u0440\u0435 \u0443\u043a\u0440\u0430\u0448\u0435\u043d\u043d\u044b\u0435 \u043a\u0430\u0440\u0442\u044b \u0438 \u0448\u043b\u044f\u043f\u0430-\u0442\u044b\u043a\u0432\u0430 \u0434\u043b\u044f \u0428\u0435\u0444\u0438\u043a\u0430\",null,\"3\u3064\u306e\u30b3\u30b9\u30c1\u30e5\u30fc\u30e0\u3001\u98fe\u308a\u3064\u3051\u305f4\u3064\u306e\u30de\u30c3\u30d7\u3001\u305d\u3057\u3066Sefik\u306e\u30ab\u30dc\u30c1\u30e3\u5e3d\u5b50\",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,\"\u00dc\u00e7 kost\u00fcm, s\u00fcslenmi\u015f d\u00f6rt harita ve Sefik'e balkaba\u011f\u0131 \u015fapka\",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_summary\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_title_image\":[\"f10bffad555ed3141190d6276911d41f767838c9.png\",null,null,null,\"eef9d81b78606d553b5c0078ff81a53dec5344dd.png\",null,\"d0c91e5119d1d7cba93bd6057616432328bfb30d.png\",\"0873f99c08b72512039c24a7d6f10c97f49fffc1.png\",\"920facca8ca0857a60b0df61fdbc027b28e99a18.png\",null,\"02e9417252d8fbcc02d059d8bb6657137d442716.png\",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,\"f10bffad555ed3141190d6276911d41f767838c9.png\",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_capsule_image\":[\"344b44747e26c927d76d0f1dc8a8e90b2ac8f9a9.png\",null,null,null,\"c979a338e0f36852aef8660728141e2c5244b3ba.png\",null,\"ddc97a9e3008af87a110abe2efb0360c67597ba6.png\",\"183dc9ff444878506b0043585071112cd4a6962b.png\",\"8979f3ed8d9b23eb2e3131d1e799fce1d82473d8.png\",null,\"bb24f261c46a869048f08eeaa7a3f75fc9dfa32d.png\",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,\"344b44747e26c927d76d0f1dc8a8e90b2ac8f9a9.png\",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"bSaleEnabled\":false,\"sale_show_creator\":false,\"sale_sections\":[],\"sale_browsemore_text\":\"\",\"sale_browsemore_url\":\"\",\"sale_browsemore_color\":\"\",\"sale_browsemore_bgcolor\":\"\",\"localized_sale_header\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_sale_overlay\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_sale_product_banner\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_sale_product_mobile_banner\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_sale_logo\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"sale_font\":\"\",\"sale_background_color\":\"\",\"sale_header_offset\":530,\"referenced_appids\":[],\"bBroadcastEnabled\":false,\"broadcastChatSetting\":\"hide\",\"default_broadcast_title\":\"#Broadcast_default_title_dev\",\"localized_broadcast_title\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_broadcast_left_image\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_broadcast_right_image\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"broadcast_whitelist\":[],\"bScheduleEnabled\":false,\"scheduleEntries\":[],\"library_spotlight\":true}","announcement_body":{"gid":"678512495722234739","clanid":"46274181","posterid":"0","headline":"\ud83c\udf83 Dude, Trust Me is in costume for Halloween \ud83e\udd87","posttime":1792187094,"updatetime":1792235979,"body":"[p]Halloween is here, just in time for Steam Next Fest. Grab your two friends and see who you're stuck with this time.[\/p]\n[h3]\ud83c\udfad Costumes[\/h3]\n[list]\n[*]The Blind's head is a jack-o'-lantern, and its grin moves when you talk.\n[*]The Deaf wears devil horns over the headphones.\n[*]The Mute found a witch hat.\n[*]Sefik wears a carved pumpkin.\n[\/list]\n[h3]\ud83d\udd78\ufe0f Four maps, dressed up[\/h3]\n[list]\n[*]The Offering Fire: jack-o'-lanterns, a scarecrow and string lights, with bats circling overhead.\n[*]Blind Passage: bunting, a bubbling cauldron, spiders and bats.\n[*]The Sunken Dome: pumpkins, candles and a cauldron among the ruins.\n[*]Carousel Playground: the carousel wears a witch hat.\n[\/list]\n[p]The Blind can see the decorations too. That doesn't stop them walking into the pumpkins.[\/p]\n[h3]\ud83e\udd87 Menus[\/h3]\n[p]A Halloween logo, a lobby full of bats and cobwebs, a pumpkin cursor, and every launch opens on an organ.[\/p]\n[h3]\ud83c\udfae Steam Next Fest[\/h3]\n[p]The demo stays in costume through Steam Next Fest, October 19\u201326. Bring two friends, and if you have fun, add Dude, Trust Me to your wishlist.[\/p]\n[p]Dude, trust me. It's not that scary. \ud83c\udf83[\/p]","commentcount":0,"tags":["mod_reviewed","ModAct_803139239_1792190299_0","ModAct_1434278705_1792236101_4"],"language":0,"hidden":0,"forum_topic_id":"570426339809605661","event_gid":"678512495722234738","voteupcount":4,"votedowncount":0,"ban_check_result":0,"banned":0},"published":1,"hidden":0,"rtime32_visibility_start":0,"rtime32_visibility_end":0,"broadcaster_accountid":0,"follower_count":0,"ignore_count":0,"forum_topic_id":"570426339809605661","rtime32_last_modified":1792253002,"news_post_gid":"0","rtime_mod_reviewed":1792236102,"featured_app_tagid":0,"referenced_appids":[],"build_id":0,"build_branch":"","unlisted":0,"rtime_created":1792185884,"votes_up":4,"votes_down":0,"comment_type":"ForumTopic","gidfeature":"590691034935122373","gidfeature2":"570426339809605661"}],"EventWebRowEmbed":{"bPreLoaded":true,"announcementGIDList":["686394429475397170","678512495722235246"],"last_update_event":{"rtime":1792187040,"event_gid":"678512495722234738","announcement_gid":"678512495722234739","clan_account_id":46274181}}};
